{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#card-zh","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-selected-model 是面向 DSH Web 会话压缩的插件：它在全局 llm/stream 流程中拦截 compaction 请求，并读取会话中尚未消费的模型选择，将摘要请求改送到当前选中的 provider 和 model。它保留请求中的消息、工具、令牌上限与信号，也尊重显式指定的摘要模型；普通请求不会改动。适合切换模型后希望 /compact 或压力触发的自动压缩使用新模型的用户。需要 session controller 提供 modelSelection 投影；没有该投影时保持原路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-52","lib/index.js:63-78","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#card-en","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-compact-selected-model routes compaction summaries to the session's pending model choice. It intercepts compaction requests and preserves explicit summary routes and ordinary requests. It requires the session controller's modelSelection projection.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-52","lib/index.js:63-78","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-1","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"切换模型后，怎么让 /compact 用我刚选的模型？","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-78"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-2","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"让 DSH 的会话摘要跟随当前模型选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-52"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-3","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"自动压缩总是跑在上一个模型上，有办法改成当前模型吗？","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-78"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-4","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"我想保留切换模型的选择，让后续压缩摘要也使用它。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-52"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-5","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Can session compaction use the model I just selected?","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-52"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-6","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Route automatic compaction summaries to my current model choice.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-78"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#feature-1","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-selected-model 的功能「跟随当前模型压缩」：存在待处理模型选择时，压缩摘要改用所选模型；普通请求参数保持不变。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-52","lib/index.js:63-78"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#feature-2","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-selected-model 的功能「尊重显式摘要模型」：如果压缩请求目标与会话最近路由模型不同，插件将其视为显式配置并保持原样，避免覆盖用户指定的 summarization 模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-52"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#feature-3","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-selected-model 的功能「隔离非压缩请求」：只有 purpose 为 compaction 的请求才会检查会话模型选择；普通 LLM 请求和插件自己重新发出的请求会继续原有流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:59-78"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#caveat-1","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-selected-model 使用前须知：若所选模型请求失败，压缩也会失败，插件不会回退到旧模型；需切回可用模型后重试（见 lib/index.js:15-19）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-19"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#caveat-2","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-selected-model 使用前须知：功能依赖 session controller 的 modelSelection 投影；无此投影的无头运行不会重路由压缩请求（见 lib/index.js:49-52）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-52"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-7","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"切换到新模型后，自动整理上下文也想用它。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-78"]}
{"unit_id":"DenAbr__dsh-compact-selected-model#intent-8","repo":"DenAbr/dsh-compact-selected-model","commit":"cfd47c97713701e2cc180173b944acec6c1ef5df","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Make compaction follow the model selected in my session.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-52"]}
